{"id":"000VEV","title":"Right Then Wrogn","author":"dleclair","solvedCount":28,"difficulty":3,"rating":"99 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 9. Oktober 2026, 22:00 Uhr","rules":"Right Then Wrogn by Derek LeClair\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nA pair of adjacent digits along a red line must have opposite parity (even/odd).\n\nA pair of adjacent digits along a thermometer must increase as they move away from the bulb end.\n\nOn a gray line, digits must be between the digits in the circles on the ends.\n\nDigits on a blue diagonal line must not repeat along the blue diagonal line.\n\nOn a black dot, one digit is double the other.\n\nOn a white dot, digits are consecutive.\n\nDigits separated by an X sum to 10.\n\nOnce you solve the puzzle, keep all the digits in the yellow squares and erase the rest.\n\nNow solve it again, except all the rules are wrong\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nA pair of adjacent digits along a red line must not have opposite parity (even/odd).\n\nA pair of adjacent digits along a thermometer must not increase as they move away from the bulb.\n\nOn a gray line, digits must not be between the digits in the circles on the ends.\n\nDigits on a blue diagonal line must repeat along the blue diagonal line.\n\nOn a black dot, neither digit is double the other.\n\nOn a white dot, digits are not consecutive.\n\nDigits separated by an X do not sum to 10.\n\nSolve in SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Row 1","tags":["Sudoku","Kropki","Thermo (Variante)","Parität (Thema)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/usoeob2cqm","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/usoeob2cqm","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}